<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sack of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from December 12 to December 18, 1996:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.55</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 60.23</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.92</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 65.03</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$159.20</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$119.40</p>
<p>    Unsweetened or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 84.35</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.15</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.12</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.41</p>
</text>
